 "text": "Recorder | Henry County, OH\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nServices\nBusiness\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nAuditor\nAgriculture\nAgricultural District\nCurrent Agricultural Use Value (CAUV)\nHenry County Ohio Tax Rates\nDog Tag Registrations\nForms & Publications\nHenry County Treasurer\nManufactured Homes\nReal Estate\nDestroyed Property\nReal Estate Inquiry\nReal Estate Taxes\nReduced Real Estate Taxes\nValuation Complaints\nReal Estate Inquiry\nUnclaimed Funds\nHenry County Recorder\nHomestead Exemption\nHenry County GIS Map\nDelinquent List\nClerk of Courts\nCommon Pleas Judge\nDomestic Relations / Juvenile Divisions\nProbate / General Divisions\nProbate Division\nCoroner\nEngineer\nMunicipal Court Judge\nProsecuting Attorney\nRecorder\nSheriff's Office\nConcealed Carry Weapon (CCW) Licensing\nCCW Initial Licensing Requirements\nCCW Renewal Licensing Requirements\nConcealed Carry Application (PDF)\nCivil Process\nSheriff Sales\nSheriff Sale Dates\nTax Sale Dates\nSex Offender Registration\nSex Offender Search\nCorrections Center of Northwest Ohio (CCNO)\nRoad Deputies\nK9 Unit\nProject Lifesaver\nSpecial Deputies\nGolf Cart Inspections\nTreasurer's Office\nPayment Methods\nTax Installment Prepay Plan\nReal Estate Inquiry\nHenry County Ohio Yearly Tax Rates\nDelinquent Taxes\nTax Information\nUnclaimed Funds\nUnclaimed Tax Sale Funds\nResources for Struggling Tax Payers\nRemission of Penalties Form (PDF)\nHome\nGovernment\nElected Officials\nRecorder\nRecorder\nThe county recorder is the official keeper of real estate records for the county. It is this office's function to provide protection to persons and property by recording a variety of legally essential documents. The recorder accepts: Deeds, Mortgages, Mechanic's Liens, Powers of Attorney, Recognizance Bonds, IRS Liens, Corporate Franchise Liens, Subdivision Plats, Military Discharges, Worker's Compensation Liens, Partnerships and other instruments for recording\nThe county recorder also records all county and township zoning resolutions and amendments.\nTerm\nThe Recorder serves a term of 4 years and is elected with the presidential election.\nAdditional Information\nFind more information on the Henry County Recorder website .\nContact Us\nBrandi Baden\nCounty Recorder\nEmail Brandi Baden\nRecorder\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n660 N Perry Street\nSuite 202, 2nd Floor\nNapoleon , OH 43545\n660 N Perry Street Suite 202, 2nd Floor Napoleon OH 43545\nDirections\nPhone: 419-592-1766\nHours\nMonday through Friday\n8:30 am to 4:30 pm\nClosed: Saturday, Sunday, and Legal Holidays\nDirectory\nCourthouse\nQuick Links\nOhio Recorders Association\nHenry County Recorder\nView All Links\n/QuickLinks.aspx\n-->\nAgendas & Minutes\nAlerts\nOnline Auction\nEmployment\nBids\nHenry County Commissioners\n1853 Oakwood Avenue\nNapoleon, OH 43545\nPhone: 419-592-4876\nCommissioner Hours\nMonday through Friday\n8 am to 4:30 pm\nPopular Resources\nStaff Directory\nElected Officials\nVoter Registration\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
